      "text": "L’équipe a été dissoute !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_msg_00_01",
      "hash64": "49EB467ABC045797",
      "text": "Aucune équipe n’a été trouvée.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_msg_00_02",
      "hash64": "49EB477ABC04594A",
      "text": "Vous ne pouvez pas rejoindre l’équipe.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_msg_01_00",
      "hash64": "48AFFB7594F6BCD5",
      "text": "Souhaitez-vous quitter l’équipe ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_msg_01_01",
      "hash64": "48AFFA7594F6BB22",
      "text": "Vous avez quitté l’équipe !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_msg_01_02",
      "hash64": "48AFF97594F6B96F",
      "text": "Souhaitez-vous jouer avec cette équipe ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_msg_02_00",
      "hash64": "7719798DA1EC3CC2",
      "text": "Souhaitez-vous dissoudre l’équipe ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_msg_03_00",
      "hash64": "1F6D2F86056CE033",
      "text": "La partie commencera une fois que toute l’équipe\\naura terminé ses préparatifs. Veuillez patienter...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_con_00_00",
      "hash64": "79E59C9EB0672FA5",
      "text": "Oui",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_con_00_01",
      "hash64": "79E59B9EB0672DF2",
      "text": "Non",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_01",
      "hash64": "4B3DD23D885F6D3A",
      "text": "Saluuut ! Ça te tente, une Chasse aux Monstres ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_02",
      "hash64": "4B3DD13D885F6B87",
      "text": "Allez ! Les ballons ont qu’à bien se tenir !\\nSuis-moi. Je vais te montrer où ça se passe !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_03",
      "hash64": "4B3DD03D885F69D4",
      "text": "À la prochaine !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_04",
      "hash64": "4B3DCF3D885F6821",
      "text": "T’as remporté ta première Chasse aux Monstres\\nau niveau facile ! Tu mérites une récompense !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_05",
      "hash64": "4B3DCE3D885F666E",
      "text": "Je suis sûre que t’arriveras à exploser tous\\nles scores au niveau moyen, maintenant !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_06",
      "hash64": "4B3DCD3D885F64BB",
      "text": "T’as gagné ta première partie au niveau moyen.\\nC’est super ! Voici une jolie récompense !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_07",
      "hash64": "4B3DCC3D885F6308",
      "text": "Je suis sûre que le niveau difficile sera\\nqu’une formalité pour toi, maintenant !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_08",
      "hash64": "4B3DCB3D885F6155",
      "text": "Je savais que tu gagnerais au niveau difficile !\\nToutes mes félicitations !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_08_2",
      "hash64": "925FF7862C6613A4",
      "text": "Je connais un Pokémon qui aurait bien besoin\\nd’un[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e Dresseu[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0201)]rse comme toi...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0201"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_08_3",
      "hash64": "925FF8862C661557",
      "text": "Chaque fois que quelqu’un participe\\nà la Chasse aux Monstres, il y a un Goinfrex\\r\\nqui fait irruption dans la partie.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_08_4",
      "hash64": "925FF5862C66103E",
      "text": "Il est tellement glouton qu’il rend la chasse plus\\ndifficile pour tout le monde...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_08_5",
      "hash64": "925FF6862C6611F1",
      "text": "C’est pourquoi j’aimerais vraiment te confier\\nce Goinfrex !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_08_6",
      "hash64": "925FF3862C660CD8",
      "text": "La jeune fille vous confie un Goinfrex !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_09",
      "hash64": "4B3DCA3D885F5FA2",
      "text": "Oups ! On dirait que tes boîtes sont pleines !\\nReviens quand t’auras fait de la place !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_10",
      "hash64": "4B3A4D3D885C5564",
      "text": "Ça me tente !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_11",
      "hash64": "4B3A4E3D885C5717",
      "text": "Je suis venu[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e récupérer le Goinfrex !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
